ROTK is a VR rhythm game based on your reflex and lightsaber skill.\n\nDeflect shots, slash projectiles, slash enemies, dodge obstacles, use your powers to break others. All this to the beat of a dark techno song in hand-crafted levels designed to match the music.\n\nFeatures :\n\n- Makes you feel epic - Deflect the shots like a jedi, slash your enemies, destroy walls with force impulse. You'll feel so powerful you won't want to stop.\n- Designed by hand levels - All the levels are hand crafted to be unique and fit each song.\n- Six stages declined in 3 difficulties to match the skills of everyone.\n- Improve your skill in a configurable training module and master your lightsaber.", "short_description": "ROTK is a VR rhythm game based on your reflex and lightsaber skill.\n\nDeflect shots, slash projectiles, slash enemies, dodge obstacles, use your powers to break others. All this to the beat of a dark techno song in hand-crafted levels designed to match the music."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.voxel-arch.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VArch", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rotk.voxel-arch.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "ACTION", "MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "685131475926461"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 14, "node